  "title": "VLA-Precision and RL-VLA$^3$ for Real-World Online RL of Vision-Language-Action Models",
  "summary": "VLA-Precision addresses the limitations of existing VLA models by integrating real-world online reinforcement learning (RL) to enable autonomous trial-and-error improvement, while RL-VLA$^3$ introduces a fully asynchronous framework for VLA training to address the system-level challenges of VLA training.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "VLA-Precision enables autonomous trial-and-error improvement beyond demonstrations alone, with 98.3% mean success rate in 45.8 min/task.",
      "confidence": 0.95
